+ * static there and therefore not linkable from this DLL). The source is the
+ * interleaved two-plane layout wined3d writes into the sysmem copy: a luma
+ * plane of pitch_in * height bytes followed by the interleaved U/V plane. */
+static int cliptobyte_yg(int x)
+{
+    return x < 0 ? 0 : (x > 255 ? 255 : x);
+}
